# Kher Keep: "{1}{R}, {T}: Create a 0/1 red Kobold creature token named Kobolds of Kher Keep." The {R} must be paid
# with red and the {1} may be paid with anything. Turn 7 floats {W}{W}{R}: the Mountain's {R} goes to the {R}, one
# Plains' {W} to the {1}, and the other {W} is left floating. The Keep's own tap is part of the cost.

